---
/** Anti-spam field: off-screen rather than `display: none` (which some bots skip), hidden from assistive tech and the keyboard. */
---

<div class="absolute -left-[9999px] size-px overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
  <label>
    Website
    <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
  </label>
</div>
